@RepUnderwood So you would force everybody who doesn’t need this to pay for the few who do? 

We want to keep healthcare cost down and not pay for things that are overpriced because people think they need it. 

Sex changes should never be paid for, IVF is for the few, why should the whole pay?

@RepUnderwood Eligible US citizens are fully funded in the budget bill…

Illegals are not eligible… you can sponsor with your own money…

Voters emphatically said NO to providing free healthcare, food assistance, housing and other benefits to illegals… take care of US citizens…
